  },
  "49d40e992ed4": {
    "text": "The same scene through a circular AeroSense lens: orange contour lines rise from the rice sack; outside the circle the food still looks normal.",
    "tag": "alt"
  },
  "2ecabf06f5b8": {
    "text": "Membrane close-up: an insect odorant receptor (OR) and its co-receptor Orco form an ion channel; calcium ions pass through and GCaMP sensors glow faintly green.",
    "tag": "alt"
